# Search-surface control (ripgrep/Grep honors this like .gitignore, git does NOT).
#
# Everything listed is historical evidence, tool output, or vendored bulk that
# CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md already mark non-authoritative. Keeping it out of every
# repo-wide search is what makes "the archive is not the source of truth"
# mechanical instead of advisory. To deliberately search history:
#   rg --no-ignore -g 'docs/archive/**' <pattern>
docs/archive/
supabase/migrations_archive/
archive/
tools/**/node_modules/
.claude/skills/**/node_modules/
.agents/skills/**/node_modules/
.momentic/
.momentic-mcp/
.playwright-mcp/
frames/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.helm/
.superpowers/
.ultracode/
.dev-assets/
